    "created_at": "2015-04-04T16:35:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-04-04T16:35:09Z",
    "body": "> But this all seems what you are planning to ignore all things proposed by different people and again decide all off-line.\n\nAs far as I can tell @jakearchibald is doing a great job at making progress. You don't make progress with lots of repeated arguments though, you need to experiment, talk to the wider community, etc. Which is why he's probably not always updating that thread, which has over a 100 posts now and does not seem any closer to a solution.\n",
